# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers (apps/api/docker-entrypoint.sh,
# services/executor/docker-entrypoint.sh) — a CRLF shebang line
# (`#!/bin/sh\r`) fails with "no such file or directory" in the container,
# a confusing failure mode entirely caused by checking these out on
# Windows. Force LF regardless of this repo's/contributor's core.autocrlf.
*.sh text eol=lf
